    37	READ = """# Blind reader: which of these big matters does this library hold a question on? (read-only)
    38	
    39	You are a senior hedge-fund analyst covering NVIDIA. Below are the big matters readers listed from the news of 2026-09-07 to 09-20, each with
    40	an example question, and the library of one research system as it stood on 2026-09-20: every question it held, open or closed, with its id,
