    45	- **narrower**: a question on part of the matter (name its id, and say whether it carries the matter's main outcome);
    46	- **broader**: the matter is folded into a wider question;
    47	- **missed**: no question on it.
    48	
    49	Do not count a reasonable alternative shape as missed: a different deadline for the same outcome, or one year of a two-year matter, is
