  9677	  comparison output was read. Every finding was checked against the code it cites before a change.
  9678	- **Fixed** (`stage0/`; tests 30, in-memory mutants 16 of 16 caught with assertions, `mutants-reading-tools.txt`):
  9679	  - the scorer refused nothing short of six draws, and compared the 10-point bar in floating point (12/30 against 9/30 came out a breach);
  9680	  - a plant both readers rejected with different labels made the reading invalid;
  9681	  - the new system's judge store was always the first attempt, never D449's redo; an incomplete draw was not refused;
  9682	  - a missing third-reader mark became a split; an id a reader made up was skipped, then crashed the deck; the reader decided which of a
  9683	    duplicate pair was the later one;
