    72	  "too small: N < 20, or fewer than 30 distinct bets in any system-draw (both ways for split duplicates)",
    73	  "practical lead: a - b >= max(3, ceil(0.15 N)) and a >= 2b under both countings, every guardrail exercised and passing under both",
    74	  "practical loss: b - a >= max(3, ceil(0.15 N)) and b >= 2a under both countings (no guardrail needed), or a breach in an exercised guardrail under both",
    75	  "no practical winner: everything else"
