**The native-ID sampler, redo path, +10-point boundary and prior-round debate lookup are fixed.** I accept D675’s readings on excluding covering cards, accepting two explicit plant rejections with different labels, and preserving actual rung and library counts. Twenty-one fixture-free tests passed. [D675](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:9678) · [Sampler](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/mark_cards.py:103)

- **Eligibility is still open.** The exporter reads the successful redo, but checks completion alone. Verify D667’s one-hour launch window, 72-hour send window, original draw identities and cutoff snapshots. Bind the snapshots, frozen matter list, mapping and deck key to the verdict. The scorer currently checks six labels, and a new deck can overwrite the shared key. [D667](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:9487) · [Exporter](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/mapping.py:99) · [Scorer](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/score_comparison.py:128) · [Key](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/mark_cards.py:144)
- **Mapping can still silently lose credit.** Both third votes and duplicate ordering are fixed. Validation still accepts `opened` with no ID and `narrower` without a main-outcome judgment. I accept omitting full articles from every prompt. Give both third readers the relevant source excerpt when coverage turns on a date or period. [Validator](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/mapping.py:125) · [Third-reader prompt](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/mapping.py:225) · [A2](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/week/brief-A2.md:3)
- **Cards still omit publishers.** The multiline fix holds, but the renderer supplies speaker and original source. In historical stores, the publisher was absent from the card for 174 of 582 evidence lines checked. Resolve it from the archived input ID. Closed prompts keep the key and other marks out of independent reading. In debate, preserve agreed fields and enforce the 40-word reason limit. [Card spec](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/card-spec.md:8) · [Renderer](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/build_cards.py:83) · [Marking](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/mark_cards.py:154)
- **Plants can still be correct.** A different adjacent answer can be the supported one when the original answer was wrong. Move from the stored rung position and independently confirm the changed answer is rejectable before admitting it. Also print how each counting resolved splits, as the plan requires. [Plant pool](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/mark_cards.py:84) · [Plan](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v12.md:167)

